{"theory":"pf9-c","chiral_algebra":"\\mathrm{PF}_{9}^{C}","Z_tex":"Z = \\tfrac12\\big(Z_{1,1}+Z_{1,C}+Z_{C,1}+Z_{C,C}\\big) = \\sum_{m\\neq 0\\ \\mathrm{pairs}} |\\Phi^l_{m}|^2 + \\sum_{l\\ \\mathrm{even}}\\big(|\\Phi^{l,+}_0|^2+|\\Phi^{l,-}_0|^2\\big) + \\sum_{y}\\big(|\\mathcal{T}^+_y|^2+|\\mathcal{T}^-_y|^2\\big)","character_tex":"Parafermion characters (string functions) $\\Phi^l_m$ from $\\chi^{SU(2)_k}_l(\\tau,z) = \\sum_{m\\in\\mathbb{Z}_{2k}}\\Phi^l_m(\\tau)\\,\\Theta_{m,k}(\\tau,z)/\\eta(\\tau)$, fields $(l,m)\\sim(k-l,m+k)$. On the $C$-fixed fields $(l,0)$, $l$ even, the twined characters are $t_l = (-1)^{l/2}\\eta(2\\tau)^{-1}\\sum_{x\\equiv l+1\\ (2K)}\\sin\\frac{\\pi x}{2}\\,q^{x^2/4K}$, $K = k+2$, and $\\Phi^{l,\\pm}_0 = \\frac12(\\Phi^l_0\\pm t_l)$. Twisted characters: $\\mathcal{T}_y = \\eta(\\tau/2)^{-1}\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb{Z}}(-1)^n q^{(y+2Kn)^2/16K}$ ($y\\equiv k$ mod 2, $0<y\\le k$), of weight $h = \\frac{k-2+y^2}{16K}$; $\\mathcal{T}^{\\pm}_y$ are its parts with $L_0-h$ in $\\mathbb{Z}$ and $\\mathbb{Z}+\\frac12$. Here $k = 9$.","description":"Orbifold of the diagonal $\\mathbb{Z}_{9}$ parafermion theory by charge conjugation $C: \\Phi^l_m\\to\\Phi^l_{-m}$ (Dijkgraaf-Vafa-Verlinde-Verlinde 1989). The untwisted sector keeps one copy of each pair $\\{(l,m),(l,-m)\\}$ and the $C$-even parts of the 5 fixed fields $(l,0)$; the twisted sector $Z_{C,1} = \\sum_y|\\mathcal{T}_y|^2$ is the Poisson resummation of $Z_{1,C} = \\sum_l |t_l|^2$, projected to integer spin. Lightest twisted state: $h = \\bar h = 1/22$.","generator":"scripts/spectra/gen_pf_orbifolds.py","c":"16/11","irreducible":true,"cutoff":"8","s_error":5.6e-16,"gap":"8/99","blocks":[{"label":"\\Phi^{0,+}_{0}","h":"0","coeffs":[1,0,1,1,3,3,7,8,16]},{"label":"\\Phi^{0,-}_{0}","h":"3","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,8,11]},{"label":"\\Phi^{1}_{-1}","h":"4/99","coeffs":[1,1,2,4,7,12,20,32,51]},{"label":"\\Phi^{2}_{-2}","h":"7/99","coeffs":[1,1,3,5,10,16,28,44,71]},{"label":"\\Phi^{2,+}_{0}","h":"2/11","coeffs